      "display_name": "SciPy IVP Lotka-Volterra — ScaleGamma (mean-prey identity)",
      "description": "By the Lotka-Volterra time-average identity ⟨prey⟩ = gamma / delta, scaling the predator death rate gamma by factor > 1 must strictly increase the time-averaged prey population mean_prey, even when the integrator is SciPy's adaptive RK45.",
