      "display_name": "SciPy IVP Lotka-Volterra — EvalGridRefinement (trapezoidal-mean convergence)",
      "description": "SciPy adaptive RK45 decouples solution accuracy from num_eval_points (which only controls the output sampling grid). Doubling num_eval_points must leave mean_prey within tolerance because the trapezoidal time-average over a denser eval grid converges to the same continuous time-average ⟨prey⟩ = gamma/delta.",
